    "## ✏️ Exercises\n",
    "\n",
    "### A — Eigenvalue Interpretation (by hand)\n",
    "You fit DMD to a 2-back trial and get eigenvalues:\n",
    "`λ = [0.95 + 0.1j, 0.95 - 0.1j, 0.7 + 0.0j, 0.05 + 0.0j]`\n",
    "\n",
    "1. For each eigenvalue: is it decaying, growing, or stable? Is it oscillatory?\n",
    "2. What frequency (in Hz at srate=1200) does the complex pair correspond to?\n",
    "3. What biological process might generate a mode with |λ| = 0.95 and f ≈ 8 Hz?\n",
    "\n",
    "### B — Cross-Condition Transfer\n",
    "Fit A on 0-back data. Apply it to predict the next state for 2-back trials. Compute prediction error. Compare to fitting A on 2-back data directly. How much worse is the 0-back model on 2-back data?\n",
    "\n",
    "### C — Forgetting Factor Sensitivity\n",
    "Run RLS with λ = 0.90, 0.95, 0.99. Plot |λ_max| over time for each. What's the tradeoff?\n",
